
Description:

The X-JMAP-PRIVACY iCalendar property has been deprecated in favor of using
the CLASS property.


Documentation:

RFC 5545, Section 3.8.1.3.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Installations that have used, and depend on, the X-JMAP-PRIVACY property
must migrate their iCalendar data to use the CLASS property instead.
